# 1. Ignore absolutely everything by default
*

# 2. Allow the .gitignore file itself so changes are tracked
!.gitignore

# 3. Allow your specific project folders (leave the trailing slash)
!neoxnova/

# 4. IMPORTANT: If you want to allow files nested deeply inside those folders, 
# you must ensure Git doesn't block any subdirectories inside them
!neoxnova/**